{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03308","headline":"度大庾岭 · 宋之问","name":"度大庾岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"度岭方辞国，停轺一望家。\n魂随南翥鸟，泪尽北枝花。\n山雨初含霁，江云欲变霞。\n但令归有日，不敢恨长沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷五一、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》宋之问条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}